# Rank 540 / CVE-2026-11422: Crossnote TypeScript code execution.
# Ledger verification: VYQL-INJ-003/VYQL-INJ-002 catch direct code execution.

test "rank540: Crossnote evaluates user markdown expression"
  lang javascript
  file preview.ts
  expect VYQL-INJ-003
  code
  ```
  export function render(req) {
    const expression = req.query.expression;
    return eval(expression);
  }
  ```

test "rank540: Crossnote evaluates static expression"
  lang javascript
  file preview.ts
  reject VYQL-INJ-003
  code
  ```
  export function render(req) {
    return eval("1 + 1");
  }
  ```
